{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フレンチトーストが好きでよく作るのですが、4枚切りくらいの食パンで作ります。でも一切れだと少ないし、二切れだと多すぎる、、。1人で暮らしている私はフレンチトーストを作るのに向いてないのかな〜🥺\n佐々木久美です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394ACARMCBKH3RJ4TKRGNK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394BBPBJV9REQJ5A0CA4BN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールの日、この子とホンモノの偶然ペアルックで楽しみました🐰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndシングル「ソンナコトナイヨ」を含む色々な曲が公開されています！！皆さんチェック済みですか🤓？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394CBME3FH7AZ2ZD8YG5A9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394DBAVTGREHDMPNABV45Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394EE1FYBV5BRSJ336HKFE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394FEW0BT35D50588EMVFY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394GF2K2Z29Q832H3DAYGZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソンナコトナイヨのオフショット！！！とても夕日が綺麗でした😚"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394HPZ2P7BE2HA1PVCZNBD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてください〜綺麗すぎませんか🥺とても晴れた日でたくさん踊って楽しい撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394JQ79G0NDEGTSB9NDMWR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ飛ぶかわださんかわいい（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、「窓を開けなくても」のユニットにも参加させていただきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394KQ2QAWPJNH7R55DH0PC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394MQ3JQNS0W3NVXABY90Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394NQKFMA6KPN3CSTPRTZ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394PQZAHZ4YDHAP6PNKJ23","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装をたくさん着替えたり髪型変えたりとてもオシャレでかわいいMVです！そして、ワンカット風！！ひとつでいろんなメンバーが観れるので一時停止いっぱいしてみてください🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394QVQ134CVZ6B10CNCPBX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ394RX2R5NSDPWBHD5X22KF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日からいよいよに日向坂46×DASADA LIVE&FASHION SHOW」です！\n先日発表されましたが、残念ながら小坂が映画の撮影で参加できません、、😢\nでもこさかなもグループを背負って頑張ってくれているので、私たちもこさかなの分までパワー全開で頑張ります！！！\n横浜アリーナでお待ちしております🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}